PTX WRC+barrier.sync+reader-side
"P1 (another CTA) sets a flag; P2 reads it relaxed, then meets P3 at barrier.sync; does P3, after the barrier, see the data P1 released?"
{
x=0;
f=0;
P1:r0=0;
P2:r1=0;
}
 P0@cta 1,cluster 0,gpu 0 | P1@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0 | P2@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0 ;
 st.weak x, 1             | ld.relaxed.gpu r0, f     | barrier.sync 0           ;
 st.release.gpu f, 1      | barrier.sync 0           | ld.weak r1, x            ;
exists
(P1:r0 == 1 /\ P2:r1 == 0)
